# Paypure agent workflow

Full rules: `AGENTS.md`. Read it before your first change.

- Work in your own worktree (Cursor worktree agent, or `scripts/agent/new.sh <name>`).
  Never edit, run git writes or run `docker compose` in the primary checkout.
  `scripts/agent/guard.mjs` blocks those commands.
- Behaviour changes ship with tests. `scripts/agent/check.sh` must pass, and never
  weaken it to get green.
- Ship with `scripts/agent/land.sh`. It merges main in, runs the gate, opens the PR,
  waits for CI and squash-merges. Never push to main, never force-push.
- Conflicts: AGENTS.md § Conflicts. Your own stack: `scripts/agent/stack.sh`.
